{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_289d9a45a935acc31f7ea62ef3ec1877634557a826d55c7c8d4b8e4603205e62","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8744f91448dff87c41b6928b25c5d4a03851476e8f7ea543dc824fe5aee9b08c","slc_a2904e38e51166b8b2bee98a595a233c41f0645f6e2a4470cfdce361a63f36d9","slc_fe6d3a825663ac9d473847de2a0d76fcdd44274c4d9316597c23d71265372103"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"The clean_context tool lets the model replace its own current-turn tool results with short placeholders, keeping the placeholder visible and avoiding retroactive purges so provider prompt caching is preserved.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_45962e30e2d834ed077cdaf03eeea9f64a159f35a8283dc5552f757a4659eda2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_18c7d7871be98ac9e21a1768af18016445fe96f76af03125d5493643bad62d6e","slc_396c8aa60e01b36cff911cf908c0ffe9e7b44b14d819be64e347a50389f9e8e8","slc_3a72ffd198c2a11fb1444c414f7a43a074b0402202cabf823a26077ba1a4fa71","slc_703ca31d73ff2436634133107bcfa0678d1036c27c652bb63002fa0005521983","slc_85ab5942da10ce5a2691a5741b4fcf31431c77478dfb71f8fc1c9000e004be93"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"The glob and grep implementations sit on top of ripgrep, and web_search offers two configurable providers: paid LinkUp (API key) and free Exa via public MCP.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_587cf0e6e55bf20beec41f13e0e9a714c7ed82f34585a61adfef17c9e6543972","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5ef7fcdc46b55bf7f93b2ce0c6f80ea74d61e0efe60afdeb71762b7bcb65d1e7","slc_9eae7cd2b02f2d7fa3da0c642ddd0973d73b9d87ba4a76d15447b51f0ff9ce3f"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"Sinew is a desktop AI coding harness built on Tauri 2, React, Rust, Monaco, xterm, and MCP, where every tool is toggleable, descriptions are editable, and providers are pluggable.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6c5763b2df9b4d35ca0c7048cecf05aa9ea3a69a31d73848498206f92bbc0506","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_368e422b172c755aaf70e1dd04d8aed8d1a1773630c694a7ed8ce9f1dd7e87a9","slc_90a541d4e4ce3fa9106ef21309fa9d9f2f4e372744a6791de0c1e0f97f4edeea","slc_ce6930b37c868c092183e871f75c45b986ebf260a5e49c6f7718c4e962e3786e"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"The agent has three interaction modes: Act (single-turn loop), Goal (autonomous loop until the task finishes), and Plan (a question/answer session that only ends when the user clicks send-and-stop).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6e01732b68812becd1e6bb28f9e1bd9fbb46fd3e477aa680402e35f518182a7c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1c83f74609bc2e9499ac801fc19e626d8b6b1c2f81144f5ff45ac2d0db1e5e13","slc_36ca1c638dbf5c618cb80cd6368510bca093993ecd8c410b596979abcfed2163","slc_437c55a6ff6972f0a1479a425e1f1c241004c6e689db610e41bc6257c0b2e114"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"MCP tools are not exposed directly; only a compact server/tool catalog sits in the prompt, and load_mcp_tool lazily injects the full schema on first use, staying loaded for the conversation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6fc00ef2327e15ebbfd48f04c498908366632ad35e2455ba89d95372be51d8fd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0aaf1cb9dced762243674c87d1129288b8cfb9d17da3ce2c255d54765966babf","slc_592cc595c9c4ea45d1169ca57e3522e7bc102481a7f2d5a51f135a806d21c820","slc_b711909ceb7691bc1bf7293a222bb600e9adc65f4ddd7679d008b127e6f6acfd","slc_cc5fab8fe85a7c67e37ab349baa90ee974b7a194ebe00d2cfb5f5b110bd2cd3d"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"The main agent can launch a peer-to-peer team of 2 to 8 agents with no lead; teammates coordinate through a shared task board with dependencies and messages delivered via system reminders.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8b59eadc5eec9a339be46583e3e4b9d8e1658a3ce18f67817c46b8e3d2d8a1b8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e98e1527c8fa0070c709b0e038b69ae6fff1b1c648c3a74a4197c676915edf3","slc_421129862e16638fdd7a4757af6bb6271e51f349a164e745a31127b2d34af165","slc_496a04a174a7e79951dd0aff63fbae60f0d5b5f059a71960848dfe995e9cf570"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"Sinew connects to five providers — Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Kimi (subscription/OAuth) and OpenRouter (API key) — usable in parallel so models can be mixed per mode, sub-agent, or teammate.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8fd2b0c4e6bef439dfb5907a1f87ae3c35fead3253615990e27bcb938789fb75","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_750c7876763ebc280b0df5b2b5222688a85398f81d9559caa69563dc0eced93a","slc_e90a9daa3956c2c8f0e75a1fb3691c864578a3dbf5443f178b4a148628b99214"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"Configured sub-agents are exposed as subagent_<id> tools; calling one runs a full turn with that sub-agent's model and prompt while the whole harness (tools, MCP, skills) stays active.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_93d47e2b6d411086fb4cf06f4861501a94596e35ee188cecc732ad8975ef90af","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9a2cc28b7db56bdb954d98794ad901d406937abbe4099cdfaa8c3582d6241082","slc_cc5e6a3f1b4a40716dbf32213e5d91cf022e1a6f3725693f38a4a29679f578d7","slc_d6dbc71003cf1df300f68ae891c18b493bfb0856c761e503272eaedd80ee1626"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"Rollback makes every past user message clickable, showing files changed since then and offering to revert workspace changes or keep them while undoing chat history, backed by per-turn checkpoints.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_abd1d5587ab29595ba0913267d3f267f8c5ab7fb2ffc4299d2470a8982f50c61","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a19632bb794e077c83abf70507f5f6556d13a098f0232c61394f863040ea6bc1","slc_a8c8f2bbde22f917808bad79d035f37f336c4de4a3b9b17ec1be83d873f24b87","slc_aa89a538a475380c57d716cf668c643cc3a86f6261372ec1e2c9c696194c69e4","slc_f6b60e7e37ea4b21648426b2ba59606b6b7038997251aabd5a7f481b2925f852"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"Skills are directories with a SKILL.md, discovered from four prioritized locations (.agents/skills and .sinew/skills in workspace and home), with the .agents format aligned to the Claude Agent Skills convention.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b37c78a8766b5138350bc0aa7b06ac4b2019ec7e15aab7846933f215a8fba879","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_dcc02d1934080e4ea36f366d5aaf84fa855bffbdec724b42f0851dda62f23512"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"The codebase is organized as a React UI (src/), a Tauri 2 shell (src-tauri/), provider-agnostic core types (sinew-core), the agent loop and tools (sinew-app), and per-provider adapter crates.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_da4ea9d8ba5ad2e4a5f680c6babf552b7db794af22e2d2e53c5fff0f66fd88b7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_40c253ee8ae70340e3fa355294c6b6c7b44ad928d0bf60407573f4c027acd7c0"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"The agent's toolset includes bash/bash_input, read, glob, grep, edit_file, write_file, web_search, web_fetch, create_image, question, todo_list, clean_context, load_mcp_tool, skill, subagent tools, and team tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dd474559cc1d15c08df413021d332cb343d0969decdbc7a4b075acdc105cc321","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5eed8f7c36f0dea28aa550470ed8164eaff231fb738aeff8342ac98d4139ff8d"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"The todo list's full state is re-injected into the system reminder every turn so the model always sees an up-to-date version, which the README says matters most in long Goal-mode runs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f7eb4d7b07d7e05825a646284fdfc924daa8c49db833ce69d49ae3df3a9958bb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"paseru/sinew@13b0a2187a07 snapshot 8eac9848b44c0207","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b2f97746a41e57ee7765eb29ad0d5f3090f997ea66bc40535d1e22ba72fc706","slc_469fe31ed50f487b73563f190105f6fdc8889dfe81ecb54a6f4758197650c19b","slc_d14b35f0a3cb377df5b4ae5980121080736a342f74fc5220a7ca8936c13f2720"],"source_ids":["src_3c385797f21b5032b130c0b1abdfd33d"],"text":"read, glob, and grep each require a mandatory limit parameter, forcing the model to declare how much output it wants to preserve context.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_343803c3fb724364a1023d9f225f2a85"}
